# Title: Terminal Service Process Spawn
# ID: 1012f107-b8f1-4271-af30-5aed2de89b39
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2019-05-22
# Tags: attack.initial-access, attack.t1190, attack.lateral-movement, attack.t1210, car.2013-07-002
# Description: Detects a process spawned by the terminal service server process (this could be an indicator for an exploitation of CVE-2019-0708)
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((ParentCommandLine CONTAINS "\\svchost.exe" AND ParentCommandLine CONTAINS "termsvcs")) AND NOT ((((Image="*\\rdpclip.exe" OR Image="*:\\Windows\\System32\\csrss.exe" OR Image="*:\\Windows\\System32\\wininit.exe" OR Image="*:\\Windows\\System32\\winlogon.exe")) OR (NOT Image=*))))
